```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "search one live scratch sensorium by keywords"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///sense.scratch.queries", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/sense.scratch.queries"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/sense.scratch.queries"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.scratch.queries ~ keywords against one live sensorium

`lares sensorium query <id> <keywords…>` searches one live scratch sensorium and prints a preview of each hit. An id no live sensorium holds answers not-found, exit 3.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ query

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`query` params=`id/s-1 keywords/[[harbor lights]] ~ search a live sensorium`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ id · keywords

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`id` params=`takes/id needs/required seat/1 as/<id> ~ the live sensorium's id`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`keywords` params=`takes/words needs/required seat/2 as/<keywords…> ~ the words to search`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ works this host's scratch sensoria under the cache; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · not-found

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[sense.scratch.queries id/s-1 keywords/harbor]] ~ name the id and the keywords`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`not-found` params=`cure/[[sense.scratch.lists]] ~ no live sensorium holds that id; list them`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ found · not-found

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`found` params=`exit/0 fields/[[mode found hits]] ~ the hits`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`not-found` params=`exit/3 ~ no live sensorium of that id`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares sensorium query

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares sensorium query]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~/ahu>>

